sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant Queue
    participant Worker
    participant Store as Object store
    App->>Queue: Enqueue export job
    loop Every job in the queue
        Queue->>+Worker: Deliver job
        alt Job is valid
            Worker->>Store: Read source files
            opt Files changed since last run
                Worker->>Worker: Rebuild the archive
            end
            Worker->>Store: Write archive
        else Job is malformed
            Worker-->>Queue: Reject job
        end
        Worker-->>-Queue: Acknowledge
    end
    par Notify the owner
        Queue->>App: Job finished
    and Update metrics
        Queue->>Queue: Count the job
    end
    critical Clean up temporary files
        Worker->>Store: Delete scratch space
    option Store unavailable
        Worker->>Queue: Requeue clean-up
    end
    break Quota exceeded
        Store-->>App: Refuse new jobs
    end
    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        App->>Queue: Resume intake
        Note over App,Queue: Back to normal
    end
